      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRUNKEY AVIATOR (2) was crowded for room and fell here last time. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Suited here and worth another try. VINTAGE LAD (1) is a first starter from the Craig Chappelow yard by Bernardo out of Vintage Special. Gets every chance from the inside draw. Lot to like about his profile and expected to run well. VINTAGE TIGER (4) is a handily bred pup making his debut without a trial. Can measure up. STAY AMAZING (8) is by Bernardo out of Mrs. Mouse making debut. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Profiles nicely and can feature in the finish.",
